  "body": "The README says that we should run this to set up a homeserver:\n\n`python -m synapse.app.homeserver`\n\nThis should be a script, just like synctl. It should be defined in the setup.py so we can call it directly after the project is installed, instead of calling with `python -m` and the module name.\n",
